   "title": "Mount the wall bracket",
   "note": "Screw the bracket flat to the wall · 2 wood screws per 1W column, into a stud wherever you can, with wall anchors in drywall with no stud. The pegs are raised sleeves on the bracket and each screw seats fully inside its sleeve: a screw head left standing out stops the case going on.",
